---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import HorizontalCard from "../components/HorizontalCard.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Projects" sideBarActiveItemID="projects">
  <div class="mb-8">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-2">
      Some of my pass times {"</>"}
    </div>
    <text class="text-md"
      >These are only the frontend works that I'm posting as I recently switched
      my food source to backend development. Stay tuned to see some amazing
      api's coming on the way</text
    >
  </div>

  <HorizontalCard
    title="Bluebook Insights"
    img="/projects/bluebook-insights.png"
    desc="Bluebook Insights is a web application that provides students and tutors with a comprehensive overview of their SAT Practice Test score from the official college board practice tests."
    url="https://bluebook.edisonos.com"
    badge="Full Stack"
    tags={["NextJS", "TypeScript", "Docker", "Golang", "FastAPI"]}
  />
  <div class="divider my-0"></div>
  <HorizontalCard
    title="Elecsavers"
    img="/projects/elecsavers.png"
    desc="A ecommerce application with real authentication system with better auth and a sqlite database to store all the products. There is a proper admin panel with dashboard for analytics and boards for admins to add in products and vendors and keep track of stock and payments. The user front can add in items to cart and make their purchases"
    badge="Ecommerce"
    tags={["NextJS", "Better Auth", "Turso DB"]}
    url="https://elecsavers.com/"
  />
  <div class="divider my-0"></div>
  <HorizontalCard
    title="Pranaav Enterprises"
    img="/projects/pranaavgroups.png"
    desc="A client facing website for a real civil construction company which uses NextJS as it is widely adopted framework which makes it really easy to maintain and add in content in the future. Nothing crazy stuff. Just some normal content about the business and contact details. This is a proper real world usage time with domain and email domain."
    badge="Client Application"
    tags={["NextJS"]}
    url="https://pranaavgroups.com/"
  />
  <div class="divider my-0"></div>
  <HorizontalCard
    title="Vignesh Dental Clinic"
    img="/projects/vignesh-dental-clinic.png"
    desc="There are many iteration that I did but this is one I liked the most. This is a simple website representing a dentists needs and a exposure for their potential business needs with SEO and server rendered site with View Transition API which looks buttery smooth to view without compromising load times."
    badge="Designing"
    tags={["AstroJS", "DaisyUI"]}
    url="https://vignesh-dental-clinic.vercel.app/"
  />
  <div class="divider my-0"></div>
  <HorizontalCard
    title="Toyour"
    img="/projects/toyour.png"
    desc="I liked the neobrutalism ui variant of shadcn and wanted to use it somewhere. So I did a tour planner app interface with mock data which could potentially be intergrated with actual AI responses and give suggestions for the user planning for a tour."
    badge="AI tour planner"
    tags={["NextJS", "ShadCN", "Neobrutalism"]}
    url="https://pranaavgroups.com/"
  />

  <div class="my-8 mt-16">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-2">
      Newbie Me {"</>"}
    </div>
    <text class="text-md"
      >If you really want to see the starting of my projects, here it is. Have
      fun seeing the terrible me</text
    >
  </div>
  <HorizontalCard
    title="Weather App"
    img="/projects/weather-app.png"
    desc="As everyone does a weather app as a begineer ritual. So did I. This is simple weather app with a expired API key. But here is the version if you want to see anything"
    url="https://weather-app-next-js-chi.vercel.app/"
    tags={["NextJS", "Public API"]}
  />
  <div class="divider my-0"></div>
  <HorizontalCard
    title="Age Calculator"
    img="/projects/age-calculator.png"
    desc="Simple age calculator with input validation and a js function which will parse the inputs to a datetime value and get us the age of the person from the date that they type in. A simple frontend mentor challenge"
    url="https://sid-agecalculator.vercel.app/"
    tags={["HTML", "CSS", "JS"]}
  />
  <div class="divider my-0"></div>
  <HorizontalCard
    title="AI to UI"
    img="/projects/ai-to-ui.png"
    desc="AI to UI is a web application that uses AI to generate UI components based on user input. It is a fun project that demonstrates the power of AI in creating user interfaces and the power of fundamentals in web development."
    url="https://ai-to-ui.vercel.app/"
    tags={["HTML", "CSS", "Figma"]}
  />
  <div class="divider my-0"></div>
  <HorizontalCard
    title="Calculator App"
    img="/projects/js-calculator.png"
    desc="A simple calculator app built using JavaScript and HTML. It allows users to perform basic arithmetic operations such as addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division."
    url="https://sid-themed-calculator.vercel.app/"
    tags={["HTML", "CSS", "Figma"]}
  />
  <div class="divider my-0"></div>
</BaseLayout>
